diff:1194958659:1194958551:=3c3,81%0a%3c [[099DebianEtchLtspServerStandalone|Versão 0.99]]%0a---%0a> Aqui pretendemos fazer via\\%0a> #apt-get install ltsp-server-standalone openssh-server\\%0a> #ltsp-build-client - [[http://idsorocaba.ourproject.org/anexo/ltsp-build-client-pacotes|pacotes]] instalados%0a> %0a> Usando os repositorios do Etch Oficias\\%0a> [@deb http://security.debian.org/ etch/updates main contrib%0a> deb http://ftp.br.debian.org/debian etch main contrib non-free@]%0a> %0a> '''O que vira o LTSP0.99debian11 - pois no [[http://http.us.debian.org/debian/dists/etch/main/binary-i386/|Packages.gz]] esta listado o 0.99...mas no repositorio [[http://ftp.br.debian.org/debian/pool/main/l/ltsp/|ltsp]] se encontra também versões mais novas como a 5.0.39 - ai sim seria ltsp5...ou não?... '''%0a> %0a> %0a> '''Documento fonte principal sobre a instalação'''\\%0a> '''http://wiki.debian.org/LTSP/Howto'''%0a> %0a> Telas Capturadas\\%0a> http://idsorocaba.ourproject.org/debian_etch_ltsp_server_standalone/%0a> %0a> '''Configuração da Placa'''\\%0a> Vamos aqui usar a '''eth1''', configuração da eth1 fica deste jeito.%0a> [@auto eth1%0a> iface eth1 inet static%0a>         address   192.168.0.1%0a>         netmask   255.255.255.0%0a>         network   192.168.0.0%0a>         broadcast 192.168.0.255@]%0a> depois execute...\\%0a> '''#/etc/init.d/networking restart'''%0a> %0a> '''Configuração do DHCP3-Server'''\\%0a> Para configurar o dhcp3-server, usamos o exemplo de configuração que esta:\\%0a> '''/etc/ltsp/dhcpd.conf''' ou '''/usr/share/doc/ltsp-server/examples/dhcpd.conf'''%0a> [@authoritative;%0a> %0a> subnet 192.168.0.0 netmask 255.255.255.0 {%0a>   range 192.168.0.20 192.168.0.250;%0a>   option domain-name "example.com";%0a>   option domain-name-servers 192.168.0.1;%0a>   option broadcast-address 192.168.0.255;%0a>   option routers 192.168.0.1;%0a>   option subnet-mask 255.255.255.0;%0a>   if substring( option vendor-class-identifier, 0, 9 ) = "PXEClient" {%0a>     filename "/ltsp/i386/pxelinux.0";%0a>   }%0a>   else{%0a>     filename "/ltsp/i386/nbi.img";%0a>   }%0a>   option root-path "/opt/ltsp/i386";%0a> }@]%0a> %0a> e vamos colocar no '''nano /etc/dhcp3/dhcpd.conf'''%0a> [@next-server 192.168.0.1;%0a> %0a> authoritative;%0a> %0a> subnet 192.168.0.0 netmask 255.255.255.0 {%0a>   range 192.168.0.20 192.168.0.250;%0a>   option domain-name "ltsp";%0a>   option domain-name-servers 192.168.0.1;%0a>   option broadcast-address 192.168.0.255;%0a>   option routers 192.168.0.1;%0a>   option subnet-mask 255.255.255.0;%0a>   if substring( option vendor-class-identifier, 0, 9 ) = "PXEClient" {%0a>     filename "/ltsp/i386/pxelinux.0";%0a>   }%0a>   else{%0a>     filename "/ltsp/i386/nbi.img";%0a>   }%0a>   option root-path "/opt/ltsp/i386";%0a> }@]%0a> %0a> a linha '''next-server 192.168.0.1;''' é colocado pois o etch é afetado pelo http://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=416868\\%0a> '''next-server ip.addres.of.server;''' - http://wiki.debian.org/LTSP/Howto%0a> %0a> %0a> '''Configurar o exports'''\\%0a> '''nano /etc/exports'''\\%0a> [@/opt/ltsp *(ro,no_root_squash,no_subtree_check)@]%0a> %0a> Ligue os terminais e bom divertimento.%0a
