diff:1194587307:1191386394:minor=25,91c25%0a%3c http://idsorocaba.ourproject.org/debian_etch_ltsp_server_standalone/%0a%3c %0a%3c '''apt-get install ltsp-utils''' - Este pacote não fundamental para configurar, mas ele vai ajuda a gerar/criar alguns arquivos e iniciar alguns serviços. %0a%3c %0a%3c '''Vamos Configurar'''\\%0a%3c http://idsorocaba.ourproject.org/anexo/ltspcfg-c.png%0a%3c %0a%3c '''1 - Runlevel'''\\%0a%3c e mude o Runlevel para '''5'''%0a%3c %0a%3c '''2 - Interface selection'''\\%0a%3c e escolha a interface/placa de rede que LTSP vai usar. Vamos aqui usar a '''eth1'''\\%0a%3c Configuração da eth1 fica deste jeito.%0a%3c [@%0a%3c auto eth1%0a%3c iface eth1 inet static%0a%3c         address   192.168.0.1%0a%3c         netmask   255.255.255.0%0a%3c         network   192.168.0.0%0a%3c         broadcast 192.168.0.255%0a%3c @]%0a%3c depois execute...\\%0a%3c '''#/etc/init.d/networking restart'''%0a%3c %0a%3c '''3 - DHCP configuration'''\\%0a%3c Para configurar o dhcp3-server, não vamos usar o arquivo que ltsp-utils cria, mas sim o exemplo de configuração que esta:\\%0a%3c '''#cat /etc/ltsp/dhcpd.conf''' ou \\%0a%3c '''cat /usr/share/doc/ltsp-server/examples/dhcpd.conf'''%0a%3c [@authoritative;%0a%3c %0a%3c subnet 192.168.0.0 netmask 255.255.255.0 {%0a%3c   range 192.168.0.20 192.168.0.250;%0a%3c   option domain-name "example.com";%0a%3c   option domain-name-servers 192.168.0.1;%0a%3c   option broadcast-address 192.168.0.255;%0a%3c   option routers 192.168.0.1;%0a%3c   option subnet-mask 255.255.255.0;%0a%3c   if substring( option vendor-class-identifier, 0, 9 ) = "PXEClient" {%0a%3c     filename "/ltsp/i386/pxelinux.0";%0a%3c   }%0a%3c   else{%0a%3c     filename "/ltsp/i386/nbi.img";%0a%3c   }%0a%3c   option root-path "/opt/ltsp/i386";%0a%3c }@]%0a%3c %0a%3c e vamos colocar no '''nano /etc/dhcp3/dhcpd.conf'''%0a%3c [@next-server 192.168.0.1;%0a%3c %0a%3c authoritative;%0a%3c %0a%3c subnet 192.168.0.0 netmask 255.255.255.0 {%0a%3c   range 192.168.0.20 192.168.0.250;%0a%3c   option domain-name "ltsp";%0a%3c   option domain-name-servers 192.168.0.1;%0a%3c   option broadcast-address 192.168.0.255;%0a%3c   option routers 192.168.0.1;%0a%3c   option subnet-mask 255.255.255.0;%0a%3c   if substring( option vendor-class-identifier, 0, 9 ) = "PXEClient" {%0a%3c     filename "/ltsp/i386/pxelinux.0";%0a%3c   }%0a%3c   else{%0a%3c     filename "/ltsp/i386/nbi.img";%0a%3c   }%0a%3c   option root-path "/opt/ltsp/i386";%0a%3c }@]%0a%3c %0a---%0a> http://idsorocaba.ourproject.org/debian_etch_ltsp_server_standalone/%0a\ No newline at end of file%0a
